WEBVTT

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.410
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:35.400
<i>Go as hard as you can, Manami.</i>

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.410
What's wrong?

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.160
If you see an opening, come and get me.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.660
<i>Toudou-san is fast.</i>

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.620
<i>His movements are perfectly efficient.</i>

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:47.920
<i>He climbs like he's sliding along.</i>

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.270
<i>He accelerates without making a sound.</i>

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:52.860
<i>RIDE.08  Finish Line</i>

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.860
<i>He pulls ahead without anyone realizing it.</i>

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:54.760
<i>His only inefficiency is...</i>

00:01:56.890 --> 00:02:00.710
Are you overwhelmed by my 
Sleeping Climb, Manami Sangaku?

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.210
What's wrong? Aren't you going to attack?

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:05.550
Are you just going to let me win?

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:07.610
Both this race and in 
popularity with the girls?

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:09.400
<i>...how much he talks.</i>

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:15.100
You just thought I needlessly 
speak too much, didn't you?

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.430
I'm your senior, you know.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:18.320
<i>His intuition is sharp, too.</i>

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:24.870
Well? Can we agree I'm more 
popular with the girls?

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:25.950
<i>What? That's all?</i>

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.920
Well, uh... Okay.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:30.580
Good.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.480
<i>He seems satisfied.</i>

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:35.590
<i>Maybe I'll go now while I have the chance.</i>

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:40.680
By the way, Manami, have you been 
keeping in touch with Four-Eyes?

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:54.860
No, I've... been busy.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:57.980
Really? I'd been wondering about that.

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.240
We're racing!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.360
What did you do with that thing he 
gave you after the award ceremony?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:10.710
<i>The last bus heading down the 
mountain will be leaving at...</i>

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:11.540
Um, T-Toudou-san, I'm looking for Manami-kun.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.170
Manami?

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.590
I-I promised I'd return this to him 
if I attended the Inter-High.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.310
It was originally Manami-kun's.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.570
He helped me when I was having 
trouble in the mountains.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.050
Thanks to this, I've been able to work hard.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.210
So you're connected by fate, huh?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.270
Manami!

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.120
Manami-kun, here.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.610
I, uh... Thank you so much.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:46.790
Thanks to you, I—
I'm not sure how to thank you, but...

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.250
What did you do with that bottle?

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.100
I threw it away.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:59.210
Hakone Academy placed second because he won.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.800
Because I told him to come to the Inter-High.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:03.930
Because that day...

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.520
I helped him by giving him that water bottle!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:12.270
How could I keep that bottle around?

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:16.000
I see. Let me ask you something, then.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.390
If you had known that would happen,

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.780
and found him collapsed in the mountains,
what would you have done?

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.490
Would you not have helped him?

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.780
No, you would have.

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:37.630
You can't ignore a person who's having 
trouble in the mountains, Manami Sangaku.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.500
It means you didn't make the wrong choice.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:45.010
It takes only a moment, 
and there's no going back.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:53.650
You gave everything you 
had and lost. That's all.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:58.440
If the past continues to make 
you suffer, it's simple.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.700
Take off your jersey.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.400
I told you to

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.570
ride freely, Manami.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.410
After all, it's the riding 
style that suits you best.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:21.930
It makes me sick to watch you hide in your 
cocoon and worry about reason and rank.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:26.830
When you ride that way, you're hardly 
my rival when it comes to girls!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.510
<i>Toudou-san...</i>

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.400
I can tell.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:36.750
Onoda-kun has already 
become important to you.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:40.960
He'll be someone you compete with.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.530
You'll help each other grow 
and make each other stronger.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.780
Take good care of him.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.330
Call him every day.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.200
Every day?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:06:01.710
I'm jealous you have someone to envy and despise.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:07.840
Your rival is close enough that you 
can see and race with him anytime.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.860
<i>Toudou-san...</i>

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:17.350
There's not much left.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:21.400
Give me everything you've got,
Manami Sangaku!

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:23.650
Yes, sir.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.740
That's it. That expression, Manami.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:35.700
That's the one you should wear.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.260
I can't let you take the mountains, though.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:53.680
I am the Mountain God, Toudou Jinpachi!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.370
You're amazing, Toudou-san.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.510
Thank you.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:16.840
Once we exit the Shin-Amagi Tunnel, 
to the finish line there'll be...

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.660
...two thousand meters left.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.170
Four men left.

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:23.650
I withdrew during the mountains 
all for this moment.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:28.010
We'll show you our backs at the finish line.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.630
You sure do talk a lot, Kuroda.

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:40.040
<i>I was overflowing with talent.</i>

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.410
Yeah!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.610
That's the tenth point he's scored! Amazing!

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:54.200
Come to next week's game, too, Kuroda.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:57.690
Sorry. The baseball team asked 
me to play for them next week.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:06.590
<i>No matter the sport, I improved 
faster than anyone else.</i>

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:09.210
Apparently, the baseball team 
won the district tournament!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.550
Kuroda-senpai!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.430
I heard he beat a high school 
team with the swim club, too!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.260
Maybe he'll go to the Olympics!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:21.850
<i>They called me a sports genius.</i>

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:27.250
<i>I started riding bikes in grade school 
at a friend's invitation.</i>

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.820
<i>I was exceptional at that, too.</i>

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:33.030
You're slow. Twist your body more.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:35.700
I'll be waiting for you at the top, Izumida.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.160
Wait, Kuroda-kun.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.580
<i>Bike riding, huh? This isn't bad.</i>

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:47.880
<i>Other sports like basketball and baseball 
can only be played in designated areas.</i>

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:53.300
<i>But as long as there's a road, 
you can ride a bike anywhere.</i>

00:08:55.560 --> 00:09:00.110
<i>A cage is too cramped for 
my talent to explode in!</i>

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.110
I've made my decision, Izumida.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.790
I'm going to ride bikes.

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:11.820
I'll go to Hakone Academy 
for high school with you.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:13.920
Kuroda-kun...

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:17.280
<i>Izumida was serious. He was never 
late and never missed class.</i>

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.800
<b>Difficult
Book</b>

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.790
<i>His grades were good, and he was always
reading difficult books I'd never heard of.</i>

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:26.040
<i>Honestly, he wasn't great at 
sports besides bike riding.</i>

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:31.380
<i>But his passion for bikes was absolute.</i>

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:35.500
Teach me all the little rules, Touichirou.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.220
Okay.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.800
Kuroda, we heard you're 
going to Hakone Academy.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.720
Is it for bike racing?

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:42.470
You'll be a regular in no time.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.330
I'll place first at the Inter-High.

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:52.630
<i>Everyone wanted me to do well at 
the prestigious Hakone Academy.</i>

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:56.170
<i>Which I thought was only natural.</i>

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.520
First-years, line up!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:58.240
Yes, sir!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.870
<i>Until he appeared.</i>

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.250
You guys stink.

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:16.630
I'll smell every one of you.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.220
Stink? You mean sweat?

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.080
You smell like you'll quit right away.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.500
What?

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.720
You smell like you'll 
start skipping right away.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:28.850
What?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.620
You have promise.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:37.070
You smell like a hard worker.

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:38.400
What?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.110
Th... Thank you!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:44.240
Shut up! You're too loud, idiot!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.370
Senpai, how do I smell?

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.870
Huh?

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.190
<i>Exceptional talent? Immediate regular?</i>

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.640
Do you smell anything?

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:56.390
Yeah.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.560
You smell like a shitty elite.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.590
A stinking ball of pride.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:09.770
You stink like someone who thinks he's 
a superstar at the center of the world.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:15.980
I bet you've mastered all kinds of 
sports with that cool body of yours.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.120
Are you sure you won't quit cycling?

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:23.530
And say something like, 
"Basketball is the real me"?

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.370
That's not true!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:32.400
<i>He's fast. And he stopped just a hair short.</i>

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:37.340
<i>If he had extended his elbow another
millimeter, he would've hit me in the face.</i>

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:40.660
Was I right?

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.090
Did you get mad because 
I was right, first-year?

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.180
Looks like I was right on the money.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.930
Take it back.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.180
Bike riding is unforgiving and plain.

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.510
Talent's not enough to get you anywhere.

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:57.690
It'll make you want to quit. 
Every day is difficult.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:02.280
If you can play all kinds of sports, 
you'll end up running to one of those.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.740
Are you sure you can ride 
a bike, you little baby?

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:09.330
Let go!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.960
What's wrong? Did you see a mosquito?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.090
I won't fight you.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:19.870
Fuku-chan told me not to.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:26.310
I hate guys like you!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.690
You're all talk!

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.760
You're always looking for 
ways to upset people!

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:32.710
You're not even strong, 
but you rely on violence!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:33.950
Kuroda-kun...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:34.980
Yikes.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.730
I told you I was right.

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.190
Fine.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:44.570
I'll take you on anytime.

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:49.120
I'll show you how I ride when 
all I have is cycling!

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>That was how I met Arakita Yasutomo-san.</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.560
I can smell it. I smell the finish line.

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.920
We're getting closer to our last finish line!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.270
Fuku-chan!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:05.930
Yeah.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.850
Bring it on, Kuroda!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:17.150
<i>Arakita-san's razor-sharp cornering 
is his greatest strength.</i>

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.910
<i>He's hardly applying the brakes.</i>

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:21.520
<i>Only when he feels the 
load will lose out to the</i>

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:23.440
<i>sideways G's does he brake for a moment.</i>

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:28.160
<i>He's exceptionally good 
at it, but that's not all.</i>

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.170
<i>He rides like his life depends on it.</i>

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.870
Keep up, Ashikiba!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.170
<i>I abandoned the mountains. 
I withdrew from that race...</i>

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:42.000
<i>To take this finish line.</i>

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:49.180
<i>To reach the first line in the parking 
lot at the bottom of this hill.</i>

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.130
<i>And for one more thing.</i>

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:55.330
<i>To overcome you today!</i>

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:00.060
It should be soon.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:02.050
It's about the right time.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:02.940
You're right.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:06.070
I wonder if Juichi and Yasutomo will win.

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.820
We won't lose.

00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:12.150
Yuki—Kuroda-kun is a climber,

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:14.930
but he should've hung back during 
the mountain stage in order to

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.580
help the team achieve victory.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.070
You two are close, right?

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.940
Our houses are close.

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.180
In the past, he would've charged ahead.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:28.340
But he's changed since then.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:32.320
Instead of seeing himself as the center,

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:36.000
he's started viewing himself as 
a part of the rest of the world.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.150
His ability to determine the appropriate 
action he should take in those situations

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:40.770
has become extremely accurate.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:45.150
He quit playing basketball 
and baseball for fun.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.440
He started focusing on cycling.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.490
He can do it.

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.210
I should know.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:55.910
He's always had great potential.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.660
Kuroda!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:14:59.040
<i>Arakita-san!</i>

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:04.040
<i>His smell has changed.
Is he going to go for it now?</i>

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:07.590
I'll overtake you.

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.790
I'll overtake you!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:17.860
He kept up with my corner entry!

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.810
<i>What's up with those legs?</i>

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.230
<i>How are they so flexible?</i>

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.070
<i>You're still pedaling?</i>

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:31.360
<i>Arakita-san, I hated you.</i>

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:36.120
<i>When I lost our first race,
I seriously thought about hitting you.</i>

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:41.160
<i>I didn't want to admit you 
were right, so I trained.</i>

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:43.610
Damn it. Why?

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:45.920
<i>But I couldn't win.</i>

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.590
<i>That's why I made up my mind.</i>

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:51.550
What did you want to talk about, Kuroda?

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:54.550
Huh?

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.130
Tell me how I can get stronger!

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:02.100
Please, Arakita-san!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:05.720
<i>I asked you directly how to become stronger.</i>

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.350
Ha, idiot!

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:11.700
Don't think you can get whatever 
you want just by bowing.

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:15.320
But...

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:20.000
Your desire must be pure if you're willing 
to bow your head to the guy you hate most

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.880
in order to become stronger.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.880
Not bad.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:27.860
You managed to throw away your pride.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:28.670
What?

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.940
Steal someone else's way to get stronger.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.160
That's what I did.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.040
You can do that, can't you?

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:38.390
That's the type of person you are.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:47.440
<i>Arakita-san, I only have 
gratitude for you now.</i>

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:52.030
<i>From you, I learned the joy 
of being single-minded!</i>

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.110
<i>Took you long enough, Kuroda.</i>

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:59.870
<i>I can't believe you're 
just growing now, idiot.</i>

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.000
Sorry, Fuku-chan! I let them get ahead of us!

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:05.500
Five hundred meters left!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.500
Go, Ashikiba!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.500
Go, Fuku-chan!

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:11.880
Fukutomi-san's fast!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:18.050
You got ahead of me on the last turn.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.560
I wasn't expecting that.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.370
But I'm not complimenting you.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:26.160
What are you, stupid?

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.190
You took too long to go all out, idiot.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.990
<i>Arakita-san...</i>

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:33.920
That's plenty.

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:36.150
Thank you.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:42.540
<i>Yuki-chan, thank you for your superb 
pulling and this superb position.</i>

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.830
<i>I'll win. Don't worry.</i>

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.330
<i>There's classical music 
playing inside my head!</i>

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.970
<i>My pulse is pounding.</i>

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:02.260
<i>My body is overjoyed.</i>

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:09.190
<i>My heart is dancing,
telling me to spring forward.</i>

00:18:09.840 --> 00:18:13.320
<i>Swing the baton in time with the rhythm</i>

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:19.570
<i>with all your might, Ashikiba Takuto!</i>

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:24.660
<i>He's starting a spurt.
It's his Metronome Dancing.</i>

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.180
Sorry. I'm going to win, Fukutomi-san.

00:18:34.180 --> 00:18:36.920
I never let anyone beat me twice.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.220
<i>Is he trying to go even faster?</i>

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:45.430
That's the job of Hakone Academy's ace.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.310
Ashikiba!

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:15.380
<i>I finally won.</i>

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.550
I-I won.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:23.330
Fukutomi-san.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.540
Yeah.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.070
How could you lose, Fuku-chan?

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:34.360
Don't laugh at me.

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.570
Yeah! Nicely done, Ashikiba.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:41.810
I'll pay you a million yen later as a bonus.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.200
R-Really?

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.210
No.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:48.030
Hey, come on. You can't 
actually be disappointed.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.550
You're so mean, Yuki-chan.

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:51.710
They're not bad.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.300
Thank you!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:02.590
Thank you for three years of service!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:08.410
Ashikiba!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:11.850
Keep a straight face
in front of the upperclassmen!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.530
This belongs here!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.120
Become stronger.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:33.070
And at next year's Inter-High...

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.580
Return Hakone Academy to its rightful place!

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.710
Yes, sir!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:40.580
We will.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.800
Line up!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:59.360
<b>Sohoku
Bicycle
Racing
Club</b>

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.370
Good work, everyone.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.360
I look forward to riding 
with you again tomorrow.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.740
Naruko-kun, welcome back.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:13.170
You went to Osaka, right?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.210
Did you get some rest?

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.710
<b>Takoyaki</b>

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.120
These are for you.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.180
What? Takoyaki?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.180
I'm back, Teshima-san.

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:10.770
Okay, let's do this.

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:15.330
Now that the fun ride is over,
we can focus on exams.

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.810
I knew it was getting colder, but I 
can't believe it's the first snow.

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:19.500
Huh?

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:20.740
What is it, Fuku?

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:23.410
Juichi, do you want to play in the snow?

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:27.430
What? Fuku-chan wouldn't do 
something so childish, idiot.

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:31.260
Good idea.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.700
Let's do it, Fuku-chan.

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:33.890
For real.

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:36.330
Even if it snows, I am strong!

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>NEXT RIDE  New Sohoku, Start!</i>

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:44.900
